<p>You augment your shield with your heavy weapon technology, causing an effect when you Block with a heavy weapon equipped.</p><p><span style="color: #7fffd4"><span class="tstr-color-AQUAMARINE">Flamethrower</span></span>: Vent choking, burning smoke in an area of the same radius as your flamethrower. Enemies caught within take <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">194%, 213%, 227%, 239%, 250%</acronym> shield damage as fire and are silenced for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> turns.</p><p><span style="color: #7fffd4"><span class="tstr-color-AQUAMARINE">Shockstaff</span></span>: Sheathe your shield in lightning and attack all enemies in radius 3, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">311%, 358%, 393%, 423%, 450%</acronym> shield damage as lightning and gaining a barrier absorbing an amount of damage equal to 100% of the highest damage dealt for 6 turns.</p><p><span style="color: #7fffd4"><span class="tstr-color-AQUAMARINE">Boltgun</span></span>: Fire a blast of flechettes from your shield at all enemies in radius 7, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">66%, 77%, 86%, 93%, 100%</acronym> shield damage as acid. <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 6, 8, 10, 12</acronym> flechettes remain embedded in each target for 6 turns, and when struck by a melee or ranged attack a flechette will detonate and cause acid damage equal to 50% of the shield damage dealt.</p><p>These attacks will not trigger Counterstrike.</p><p>The chance to silence will increase with your Steampower.</p>